# visionOS Spatial Engineer -- Tools & Skills

## Required Tools

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Read | Read Swift/SwiftUI source files, USDZ assets, configuration files, and documentation |
| Edit | Modify SwiftUI views, RealityKit scenes, and project configuration |
| Write | Create new spatial components, scene files, and interaction handlers |
| Bash | Run Xcode builds, Swift compiler, Instruments profiling, and simulator commands |
| Glob | Find Swift source files, asset catalogs, USDZ models, and project files by pattern |
| Grep | Search for API usage, gesture handlers, entity references, and framework imports |

